        "date": "2026-10-22T05:57:23Z"
      },
      "message": "Add check_in_radius_feet alongside meters for events.\n\nAdds the feet-determined check-in proximity on events, default is 250 feet, but doesn't change behavior yet. check_in_radius_meters column  is still in place, but will change later.\n\nExisting data is backfilled with meters * 3.28084, rounding to the nearest foot, and clamping between 100 to 1000 feet.\n\nAny data outside of the range is clamped, counted, and printed for data integrity. A check now enforces a 100-1000 range.\n\nMeters column will be dropped soon, but separate commits will ensure it's revertible just in case and never fail a test.",
