      "message": "Compare check-in distance against the event's proximity in feet\n\nPreviously compared haversine distance for check-in service, in meters, against check_in_radius_meters.\n\nConvert's the feet-determined proximity to meters at comparison point so feet is the true comparison for nearby checks, while distance math stays in its optimal unit. Comments are left so future devs can determine the feet conversion and comparison.\n\nAdds request specs for rejection/acceptance depending on proximity. Events with different proximities are tested so they both correctly reject/approve members without affecting each other.\n\nMeters column is still working and kept for now, and is compatible with previous behaviors. Will be changed later in a future commit.",
