        "date": "2026-10-22T07:13:03Z"
      },
      "message": "Show and edit check-in proximity in feet.\n\nSwitch event form, check-in views, and office/member help text from meters to feet. Form field is now check_in_radius_feet with a 100-1000 range enforced by min/max, relies on column default and no hardcoded values.\n\nCheck_in_radius_feet now replaces check_in_radius_meters in events controller. Form no longer submits meters and is no longer allowed.\n\nAdded feet-over-HTTP assertions to check check-in request spec so strong params allow it, and updated location picker and point type feature to use feet.\n\nHelp page wording is updated where it names meters instead of feet. Anything else is deferred.",
